  "dcterms:title": "chemprop-llm training tables (PubChem annotations + EPA CoMPAIT acute inhalation LC50)",
  "dcterms:description": "A BioBricks brick that builds SELFIES/property/value training tables for an LLM regression model over chemical properties. Stage stages/01_load_pubchem.py joins three upstream BioBricks assets: PubChem compound SMILES (bb.assets('pubchem')), PubChem annotations filtered to the EPA DSSTox source (bb.assets('pubchem-annotations')), and the EPA/NICEATM CoMPAIT acute inhalation toxicity dataset (bb.assets('compait'), providing 4-hr LC50 mg/L and ppm values). Because the combined redistributable data includes CoMPAIT, which is CC BY 4.0, the governing class is attribution.",
