  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by the BioBricks licensing-provenance annotation agent (Claude). The brick has no .bb/source.jsonld and no download stage of its own; it composes three upstream BioBricks assets read via bb.assets(): PubChem SMILES, PubChem annotations restricted to SourceName=='EPA DSSTox', and CoMPAIT LC50 data. PubChem and EPA DSSTox are US federal / public-domain sources (open). CoMPAIT is CC BY 4.0 (confirmed on the biobricks-ai/compait README and NICEATM/NTP provenance). Most-restrictive-governs => attribution; commercial use permitted only with attribution => conditional. HUMAN REVIEW: confirm PubChem annotation subset carries no depositor-specific restriction, and that CoMPAIT attribution text is carried through in redistribution.",
